    "text": "By PYMNTS ,\n6 hours ago Small exporters often wait 30 to 90 days to get paid, but the cost of checking a borrower’s paperwork has long made small loans too costly for banks to write, leaving a $2.5 trillion global gap. Comfi, Hokodo and Treyd are betting AI can read invoices and payment history... Read full article",
